Project Planning Phase
# ComicCraft — AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

 ## Project Planning Phase

 The **Project Planning Phase** establishes the goals, scope, resources, schedule, risks, and development strategy for ComicCraft. It provides a roadmap for taking the project from the initial concept to a working AI-powered comic creation application.

 ## 1\. Project Vision

 **ComicCraft** is an AI-powered comic story creator that uses Gemini models to help users transform a simple idea into a structured comic.

 The planned workflow is:

```
Idea
  ↓
AI Story
  ↓
Characters
  ↓
Scenes
  ↓
Panels
  ↓
Dialogue
  ↓
Comic Preview
```

 ## 2\. Project Goals

 The project will aim to:

 - Develop an easy-to-use comic creation platform.
- Integrate Gemini models into the creative workflow.
- Generate structured stories from user ideas.
- Create detailed character profiles.
- Convert stories into scenes and comic panels.
- Generate contextual dialogue.
- Allow users to edit and regenerate AI content.
- Save and manage comic projects.
- Provide a final comic preview.

 ## 3\. Project Scope

 ### In Scope

 - User-friendly web interface
- Comic project creation
- AI story generation
- Character generation
- Scene generation
- Panel planning
- Dialogue generation
- AI-assisted editing
- Project saving and management
- Comic preview
- Export functionality, if included in the implementation

 ### Out of Scope for the Initial Version

 - Professional-level comic publishing
- Advanced animation
- Full professional illustration software
- Complex multi-user collaboration
- Large-scale social networking features

 These can be considered for future versions.

 ## 4\. Target Users

 ComicCraft is intended for:

 - Students
- Beginner comic creators
- Writers
- Artists
- Storytellers
- Hobbyists
- Content creators
- Educators

 ## 5\. Major Project Modules

 | Module | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| User Interface | Provides the ComicCraft workspace |
| Project Management | Creates and manages comic projects |
| Story Generator | Generates story concepts and plots |
| Character Generator | Creates character profiles |
| Scene Generator | Breaks stories into scenes |
| Panel Generator | Converts scenes into comic panels |
| Dialogue Generator | Creates character dialogue |
| Comic Editor | Allows users to modify generated content |
| Preview | Displays the completed comic |
| Storage | Saves project information |

