 ## 10. AI Planning

 Gemini will be integrated into several stages.

 ### Story AI

 Input:

 > "A teenager finds a mysterious door inside an abandoned library."

 Output:

 - Title
- Premise
- Plot
- Conflict
- Ending

 ### Character AI

 Generates:

 - Character name
- Appearance
- Personality
- Role
- Background

 ### Scene AI

 Converts the story into individual scenes.

 ### Dialogue AI

 Creates dialogue appropriate to the characters and scene.

 ### Panel AI

 Creates structured descriptions for individual comic panels.

 ## 11\. Prompt Planning

 Prompts should be designed to provide sufficient context.

```
User Idea
   +
Genre
   +
Story Context
   +
Character Information
   +
Scene Information
   ↓
Gemini Prompt
   ↓
Structured Output
```

 The system should preserve important context between generation steps to improve continuity.

 ## 12\. Risk Management

 | Risk | Possible Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Gemini API failure | AI features unavailable | Error handling/fallback messages |
| Poor AI output | Low-quality stories | Editing and regeneration |
| Character inconsistency | Weak story continuity | Store and reuse character context |
| API limits | Generation interruptions | Request management and limits |
| Data loss | User projects lost | Autosave/database backups |
| Complex UI | Users struggle to create comics | Simple workflow and usability testing |
| Development delays | Features incomplete | Prioritize MVP features |

