 ## 15\. Success Criteria

 The project can be considered successful when a user can:

 1. Create a new comic project.
2. Enter a basic story idea.
3. Generate a structured story using Gemini.
4. Generate relevant characters.
5. Generate scenes and comic panels.
6. Generate dialogue.
7. Edit or regenerate selected content.
8. Save the project.
9. View the completed comic in a preview interface.

